# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile.lambda only (Dockerfile-specific ignore
# file; it takes precedence over any root .dockerignore and does not affect the
# parser-worker Compose build). Allowlist: everything is excluded, then only the
# lock inputs, the application package and (for the migrate target only) the
# Alembic configuration and scripts are added back.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/src/ai_qa_copilot_api/**
!apps/api/alembic.ini
!apps/api/alembic/**

# Never in the context, even under an allowed path.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.git
.aws
apps/api/tests
docs
infra
node_modules
HANDOFF*.md
